\":3239},{\"id\":24,\"k\":\"rabbit\",\"x\":67,\"y\":43,\"ox\":67,\"oy\":43,\"hp\":1,\"fl\":0,\"tame\":0,\"dir\":-1,\"young\":867,\"born\":867,\"mom\":6,\"hx\":68,\"hy\":43,\"h\":100,\"w\":100,\"e\":71.88000000000113,\"fat\":48.37979199999966,\"starve\":0,\"run\":0,\"den\":0,\"fear\":0,\"goal\":\"mother\",\"zz\":0,\"path\":null,\"pt\":3762},{\"id\":25,\"k\":\"rabbit\",\"x\":67,\"y\":43,\"ox\":67,\"oy\":43,\"hp\":1,\"fl\":0,\"tame\":0,\"dir\":-1,\"young\":867,\"born\":867,\"mom\":6,\"hx\":68,\"hy\":43,\"h\":100,\"w\":100,\"e\":71.88000000000113,\"fat\":48.37171199999967,\"starve\":0,\"run\":0,\"den\":0,\"fear\":0,\"goal\":\"mother\",\"zz\":0,\"path\":null,\"pt\":3679}],\"w\":{\"k\":\"fog\",\"until\":1832},\"snow\":0,\"ev\":[{\"t\":0,\"d\":1,\"k\":\"arrive\",\"a\":\"Tomas washed up on the shore with nothing but the clothes he was wearing.\",\"b\":\"I woke up on a beach. Salt in my mouth, sand everywhere. No boat, no people. Just this island.\"},{\"t\":24,\"d\":1,\"k\":\"mind\",\"a\":\"Tomas stopped and thought: “Nobody's coming. Say it out loud, Tomas. Water, fire, shelter before dark. Then you can fall apart.”\",\"b\":\"Nobody's coming. Say it out loud, Tomas. Water, fire, shelter before dark. Then you can fall apart.\"},{\"t\":196,\"d\":1,\"k\":\"built\",\"a\":\"Tomas finished a campfire.\",\"b\":\"Fire! I got a real fire going. I sat and watched it for an hour.\"},{\"t\":216,\"d\":1,\"k\":\"mind\",\"a\":\"Tomas stopped and thought: “Fire's holding. Get the lean-to walls up before dark takes the warmth with it — one task, then the next, same as before.”\",\"b\":\"Fire's holding. Get the lean-to walls up before dark takes the warmth with it — one task, then the next, same as before.\"},{\"t\":489,\"d\":1,\"k\":\"plan\",\"a\":\"Tomas set himself a plan: roof before the rain.\",\"b\":\"One more night exposed like this could cost me the fire and the warmth both. Shelter comes before anything clever.\"},{\"t\":489,\"d\":1,\"k\":\"mind\",\"a\":\"Tomas stopped and thought: “Fire held all night. First night done, first fear survived. Tomorrow the walls go up before anything else can go wrong.”\",\"b\":\"Fire held all night. First night done, first fear survived. Tomorrow the walls go up before anything else can go wrong.\"},{\"t\":867,\"d\":2,\"k\":\"wild\",\"a\":\"Baby rabbits appeared near the meadow.\",\"b\":\"Saw tiny rabbits by the meadow today. Spring's here.\"},{\"t\":933,\"d\":2,\"k\":\"dogseen\",\"a\":\"A scruffy stray dog appeared at the edge of the forest.\",\"b\":\"Saw a dog today! Skinny, scruffy, watching me from the trees. How did it get here?\"},{\"t\":954,\"d\":2,\"k\":\"lesson\",\"a\":\"Tomas learned something. He's learned to handle thorny plants.\",\"b\":\"Thorns ripped my hands to bits. Gloved in a scrap of cloth now, and I lift the canes with a stick.\"},{\"t\":1001,\"d\":2,\"k\":\"mind\",\"a\":\"Tomas stopped and thought: “Cockles under the sand, mussels on the rocks. The sea pays rent twice a day.”\",\"b\":\"Cockles under the sand, mussels on the rocks. The sea pays rent twice a day.\"},{\"t\":1016,\"d\":2,\"k\":\"mind\",\"a\":\"Tomas stopped and thought: “Tide's turning, pockets full. Time to feed the fire and start hauling wood — the walls won't build themselves before the rain does.”\",\"b\":\"Tide's turning, pockets full. Time to feed the fire and start hauling wood — the walls won't build themselves before the rain does.\"},{\"t\":1020,\"d\":2,\"k\":\"realise\",\"a\":\"He found the fire had gone out.\",\"b\":\"Walked back and the fire was out. Cold ashes. I'd been telling myself it was still burning.\"},{\"t\":1020,\"d\":2,\"k\":\"realise\",\"a\":\"He has no shelter yet, whatever he tells himself.\",\"b\":\"No roof over my head yet. I have to stop pretending and build one.\"},{\"t\":1135,\"d\":2,\"k\":\"plan\",\"a\":\"Tomas set himself a plan: rebuild the fire and finish the lean-to.\",\"b\":\"Fire's out and I wasted half the morning. Shelter and heat before the fog turns to rain.\"},{\"t\":1135,\"d\":2,\"k\":\"mind\",\"a\":\"Tomas stopped and thought: “Fog's thick but the fire's five tiles back—cold ashes by now. Wood first, then I rebuild it before dark steals what warmth I have left.”\",\"b\":\"Fog's thick but the fire's five tiles back—cold ashes by now. Wood first, then I rebuild it before dark steals what warmth I have left.\"},{\"t\":1206,\"d\":2,\"k\":\"built\",\"a\":\"Tomas finished a lean-to shelter.\",\"b\":\"Built a lean-to out of branches and grass. It leaks a little, but it's mine.\"}],\"diary\":[{\"d\":1,\"txt\":\"Some days this island feels like it's trying to kill me. Fire's holding. Get the lean-to walls up before dark takes the warmth with it — one task, then the next, same as before. One more night exposed like this could cost me the fire and the warmth both. Shelter comes before anything clever. Fire held all night. First night done, first fear survived. Tomorrow the walls go up before anything else can go wrong. Fog rolled in off the sea. Tomorrow: a lean-to shelter.\"}],\"stats\":{\"built\":2,\"crafted\":0,\"meals\":3,\"hunts\":0,\"fish\":0,\"figurines\":0,\"wolves\":0,\"sick\":0,\"songs\":0,\"sunsets\":0,\"born_rabbit\":1,\"dogSeen\":1,\"wild\":{\"bramble\":959},\"beliefs\":{\"right\":9,\"wrong\":2}},\"done\":{\"fire\":true,\"leanto\":true},\"sites\":{\"bench\":2736,\"dockFrom\":2737,\"dock\":[2821,2905,2989],\"boat\":804,\"traps\":[1556,1966,712],\"cairn\":2571,\"fishtrap\":2904},\"dogId\":22,\"nextId\":27,\"lastFun\":\"\",\"home\":1728,\"dayLog\":{\"sleep\":31,\"walk\":19,\"gather\":169,\"work\":4,\"build\":120,\"drink\":4,\"chop\":104,\"trees\":1},\"m\":{\"x\":39,\"y\":29,\"ox\":39,\"oy\":29,\"tr\":[],\"dir\":-1,\"alive\":true,\"name\":\"Tomas\",\"trait\":{\"curious\":0.3188269822858274,\"romantic\":0.5426412427332252,\"musical\":0.6726081010419875,\"brave\":0.7671547133941203,\"tidy\":0.789487483445555},\"n\":{\"food\":56.35000000000416,\"water\":53.44600000000071,\"energy\":69.0599999999979,\"warmth\":66.47866720199796,\"fun\":33.239999999